<title>UK: Royal Bank of Scotland ups mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank of Scotland ups mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Royal Bank of Scotland said on Tuesday it has raised its mortgage rate to 7.25 percent from 6.99 percent for both new and existing customers with effect from January 1.</p>
<p>The bank said it was also reviewing its savings rates.</p>
<p>Most other major lenders increased their rates by a similar amount last week. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
